---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageBanner from '../../components/PageBanner.astro';

const title = 'Disclaimer | Sanshi Bio';
const description = 'Sanshi Bio website and testing disclaimer: report limits, no veterinary advice, no performance guarantee, sample limits and third parties.';

const breadcrumbLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
  itemListElement: [
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: 'https://sanshibio.net/en/' },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Disclaimer' },
  ],
};
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} jsonLd={[breadcrumbLd]}>
  <PageBanner title="Disclaimer" description="Read the report limits and responsibility boundaries before using the site or testing services" breadcrumb="Disclaimer" />

  <section class="container-site py-16">
    <div class="prose-sanshi mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500"><em>Last updated: 2026-11-24</em></p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold">1. Nature of the website</h2>
      <p>
        The Sanshi Bio website provides general information about racing-pigeon gene testing, pathogen
        testing, paternity testing, breeding and loft management. It is not legal, tax, investment,
        veterinary or race-strategy advice. Technology, products, prices and services may change; the
        quotation, order or written agreement controls the specific service.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold">2. Limits of test reports</h2>
      <p>
        A genetic report describes the received sample under the testing conditions used. It reveals
        genetic potential or the presence of a pathogen; it <b>cannot by itself be the sole basis for a
        disease diagnosis, a race prediction or a transaction price</b>. Performance also depends on
        training, nutrition, health, stress, weather and race conditions. A negative pathogen result
        does not necessarily exclude infection; a positive result does not necessarily mean clinical
        disease. Interpret results with signs, epidemiology, re-testing and veterinary advice.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold">3. No veterinary advice</h2>
      <p>
        Content about disease, vaccines, medication and control is general information, not
        <b>veterinary advice</b>. If a bird shows signs of illness, consult a licensed veterinarian.
        Do not medicate or change a vaccination programme based only on this website. Vaccine, drug and
        isolation decisions must follow local law, the product label and the actual flock situation.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold">4. No guarantee of performance, breeding or trade outcome</h2>
      <p>
        Gene and pathogen testing are decision tools, not guarantees. We do not guarantee race ranking,
        homing performance, breeding success, offspring quality, bloodline transaction value, auction
        outcome or a third party's acceptance of a report. A report does not replace training, health
        management, transaction due diligence or legal review.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold">5. Sample and testing limits</h2>
      <p>
        A result applies only to the received sample. Insufficient, degraded, contaminated or
        mislabelled samples, wrong sampling time or site, or poor storage and transport can cause
        failure, delay, false negative, false positive or an unattributable result. Acceptance,
        rejection, re-test and refund rules are in the
        <a href="/en/service-policy">Testing Service Policy</a> and the specific order. The client must
        ensure the sample is lawfully obtained, the information is accurate and the client is entitled
        to submit it.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold">6. Third-party laboratories, links and providers</h2>
      <p>
        We may use laboratories, logistics, payment, cloud hosting or other providers to deliver the
        service. Third-party sites, tools and links are operated by their own providers; we are not
        responsible for their content, availability, privacy practices or accuracy. A link is not an
        endorsement, and third-party services are governed by their own terms.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold">7. Accuracy and updates</h2>
      <p>
        We try to keep content accurate and current, but do not warrant that all information is complete,
        accurate or up to date at all times. Research, regulation, products and services change. For
        numbers, methods and conclusions, use the original source and the latest official text. Report
        errors through the <a href="/en/contact">contact page</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold">8. Intellectual property and report use</h2>
      <p>
        Website text, images, marks, report templates, methods and databases are protected by law. They
        may not be copied, adapted, published or used for commercial training without written
        permission. Reports are for the client or a written authorised recipient for lawful purposes;
        they must not be forged, altered, misquoted or used to mislead a transaction.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold">9. Liability and governing law</h2>
      <p>
        To the extent permitted by law, Sanshi Bio is not liable for indirect loss, lost profit or lost
        race results caused by use or misuse of the website, sample problems, the bird's condition,
        training, transaction decisions or third-party conduct. Liability, refund and re-test terms for
        a specific service are governed by the <a href="/en/terms-of-service">Terms of Service</a>, the
        order and applicable law, except where mandatory law prohibits a limitation. This disclaimer is
        governed by the laws of the People's Republic of China.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold">10. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this disclaimer, a report or the service: <a href="/en/contact">contact page</a>
        or <a href="mailto:martin@senobiocorp.com">martin@senobiocorp.com</a>. Related pages:
        <a href="/en/terms-of-service">Terms of Service</a>,
        <a href="/en/service-policy">Testing Service Policy</a>,
        <a href="/en/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>,
        <a href="/en/cookies">Cookie Policy</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
